msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost.compute_costs:7
msgid "executed price."
msgstr "約定価格。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost.compute_costs:10
msgid "executed volume."
msgstr "約定数量。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost.compute_costs:13
msgid "buy order. Its volume still includes the executed volume."
msgstr "買い注文。その数量にはまだ約定数量が含まれています。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost.compute_costs:16
msgid "sell order. Its volume still includes the executed volume."
msgstr "売り注文。その数量にはまだ約定数量が含まれています。"

#: ../../source/reference/generated/transaction_costs/pams.TransactionCost.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost.compute_costs:19
msgid ""
"transaction costs of the buyer and of the seller. Negative costs are "
"rebates, which are added to the cash."
msgstr "買い手と売り手の取引コスト。負のコストはリベートであり、現金に加算されます。"

